    },
    {
      "id": "flag-blocker-provider-runtime-controls",
      "status": "open",
      "description": "The ordinary route provider now has locally verified streamed success/error byte ceilings, timeout/cancellation behavior, authorization/rate/concurrency controls, no automatic retry, and a deterministic process-local closed/open/half-open circuit. Provider authorization and actual staging outage/rate-limit/multi-instance evidence are absent.",
